          <int>18</int>
        </entry>
        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>This master module parallelizes four independent single-channel accumulator engines to score four target classes simultaneously. While each 
channel processes its own 8-bit weight input to maintain distinct running totals, they all share global clock, enable, and inference-state signals. 
This ensures perfectly synchronized, overflow-safe 17-bit class score updates across the entire neural network layer.</string>
        </entry>
      </elementAttributes>
      <pos x="-40" y="-60"/>
    </visualElement>
